  "FEEDBACK": "反馈",
  "E012 OMI homepage is context-only. Domain finance/economics edges are hypothesis unless a specific source is attached. Generic LLM/agent foundations use cited papers/docs from project research.": "E012 的 OMI 主页仅供背景参考。除非附有具体来源，金融与经济领域的关系均视为假设。通用大语言模型与智能体基础能力引用项目研究中的论文和文档。",
  "Agentic systems combine a model/controller, state, tools, runtime, permissions and evaluation in an observe-decide-act loop.": "智能体系统将模型或控制器、状态、工具、运行时、权限与评估，整合到观察、决策和行动循环中。",
  "Synthesis from the project agentic-AI research note; operationalization is a design choice.": "综合自项目的智能体人工智能研究笔记；具体操作化方式属于设计选择。",
  "ReAct interleaves reasoning traces and actions for tool-using agents.": "ReAct 将推理轨迹与行动交替组合，用于能够使用工具的智能体。",
  "Use as a research anchor; benchmark outcomes are task/setup specific.": "可作为研究依据；基准结果取决于具体任务与设置。",
  "Tool-use research supports learning or evaluating API/tool selection with structured calls.": "工具使用研究支持通过结构化调用，学习或评估 API 与工具选择。",
  "Toolformer is evidence for tool-use training ideas, not production readiness.": "Toolformer 为工具使用训练思路提供证据，不代表已达到生产就绪状态。",
  "ToolLLM studies tool-use planning over large API collections.": "ToolLLM 研究面向大规模 API 集合的工具使用规划。",
  "Model and benchmark claims are paper-specific.": "模型与基准论断仅适用于对应论文。",
  "MCP Python SDK documents a protocol for interoperable tools/resources/prompts.": "MCP Python SDK 记录了用于工具、资源和提示词互操作的协议。",
  "Protocol support does not establish security or production quality by itself.": "支持该协议本身不能证明安全性或生产质量。",
  "vLLM provides an OpenAI-compatible serving path and documents batching, KV-cache and parallelism features.": "vLLM 提供兼容 OpenAI 的推理服务方式，并记录了批处理、KV 缓存和并行功能。",
  "Pin version, model revision, hardware and exact benchmark settings.": "应固定软件版本、模型修订、硬件及精确的基准设置。",
  "HELM frames evaluation as holistic across accuracy, calibration, robustness, fairness, efficiency and toxicity.": "HELM 从准确率、校准、稳健性、公平性、效率和毒性等维度进行综合评估。",
  "HELM releases and task definitions change; record version and prompt settings.": "HELM 版本和任务定义会变化，应记录版本及提示词设置。",
  "lm-evaluation-harness is an open few-shot evaluation runner.": "lm-evaluation-harness 是开源的少样本评估运行框架。",
  "Pin commit, tasks, decoding and contamination checks.": "应固定提交版本、任务和解码设置，并检查数据污染。",
  "AgentBench, WebArena, tau-bench, SWE-bench, OSWorld and BFCL provide agent/tool-use evaluation anchors.": "AgentBench、WebArena、tau-bench、SWE-bench、OSWorld 和 BFCL 提供智能体与工具使用的评估依据。",
  "Use the individual benchmark links in the research note and retain benchmark-specific limits.": "使用研究笔记中的各项基准链接，并保留每项基准的特定限制。",
  "OWASP, AgentDojo and guardrail/approval guidance identify prompt injection, tool misuse, data leakage and excessive agency risks.": "OWASP、AgentDojo 及护栏与审批指南识别了提示词注入、工具滥用、数据泄漏和过度自主权限风险。",
  "Threat taxonomy is an input to threat modeling, not proof of mitigation.": "威胁分类是威胁建模的输入，不是风险缓解有效性的证明。",
  "RAG pipelines require ingestion/chunking, indexing, retrieval/reranking, context budgeting and citation/grounding checks.": "RAG 流水线需要文档导入与分块、索引、检索与重排序、上下文预算以及引用与依据检查。",
  "Exact retrieval and groundedness metrics depend on corpus and task.": "具体的检索和证据支撑度指标取决于语料与任务。",
  "Oxford-Man Institute is the project context for quantitative-finance research themes.": "Oxford-Man Institute 是本项目量化金融研究主题的背景来源。",
  "Homepage is a context anchor; specific OMI project/task mappings remain hypotheses until a project page or paper is attached.": "主页仅作为背景来源；在附上项目页面或论文之前，具体 OMI 项目与任务映射仍为假设。",
  "Attention Is All You Need introduces the Transformer attention architecture.": "《Attention Is All You Need》提出了 Transformer 注意力架构。",
  "Architecture anchor; does not support claims about current model quality.": "仅作为架构依据，不支持对当前模型质量的论断。",
  "Chinchilla studies compute-optimal parameter/token allocation.": "Chinchilla 研究计算最优的参数与词元分配。",
  "The paper's ratios are study-specific, not universal constants.": "论文中的比例取决于具体研究，不是普适常数。",
  "InstructGPT documents SFT, preference reward modeling and PPO alignment stages.": "InstructGPT 记录了监督微调、偏好奖励建模与 PPO 对齐阶段。",
  "Results depend on prompts and raters.": "结果取决于提示词与评分者。",
  "DPO provides a direct preference-optimization objective without the standard separate reward-model/online-sampling recipe.": "DPO 提供直接偏好优化目标，无需采用通常的独立奖励模型与在线采样方案。",
  "Not a guarantee that DPO dominates RLHF.": "不能保证 DPO 优于 RLHF。",
  "GRPO and DeepSeek-R1 reports are anchors for reasoning/RL study tasks.": "GRPO 与 DeepSeek-R1 报告是推理及强化学习研究任务的参考依据。",
  "Scores and emergent-behavior claims are setting-specific and self-reported.": "分数与涌现行为论断取决于具体设置，且由报告方自行报告。",
  "DeepSeek family papers/reports document MoE, long context, multimodal and serving-relevant model variants.": "DeepSeek 系列论文与报告记录了 MoE、长上下文、多模态和与推理服务相关的模型变体。",
  "Use model-specific papers/model cards for any production decision.": "任何生产决策都应参考对应模型的论文和模型卡。",
  "FlashAttention uses IO-aware tiling for exact attention; speedups depend on sequence length, GPU and kernel implementation.": "FlashAttention 采用 IO 感知分块实现精确注意力；加速幅度取决于序列长度、GPU 和内核实现。",
  "Use as an implementation anchor, not a universal throughput guarantee.": "可作为实现依据，不是普适的吞吐量保证。",
